id: S17
target: src/sello/scalar.nim
desc: L (subgroup order) constant corrupted: the top byte of the 32-byte little-endian encoding changed from 0x10 to 0x20, doubling the encoded modulus.
====OLD====
    0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x10
====NEW====
    0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x20
====END====
